            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vifuatavyo ni vituo ambavyo Waisraeli walipiga kambi walipotoka Misri wakiwa katika makundi ya makabila yao chini ya uongozi wa Mose na Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aliandika jina la kila mahali walipopiga kambi, kituo baada ya kituo, kwa agizo la Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli waliondoka mjini Ramesesi mnamo siku ya kumi na tano ya mwezi wa kwanza, siku moja baada ya Pasaka ya kwanza. Waliondoka kwa uhodari mkubwa mbele ya Wamisri wote, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ambao walikuwa wanawazika wazaliwa wao wa kwanza wa kiume aliowaua Mwenyezi-Mungu; kwani Mwenyezi-Mungu alikuwa ameiadhibu hata miungu yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Waisraeli waliondoka Ramesesi, wakapiga kambi yao huko Sukothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Sukothi, walipiga kambi yao huko Ethamu, ukingoni mwa jangwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Ethamu, waligeuka na kurudi hadi Pi-hahirothi, mashariki ya Baal-sefoni, wakapiga kambi yao karibu na Migdoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliondoka Pi-hahirothi, wakapita bahari ya Shamu mpaka jangwa la Ethamu; walisafiri jangwani mwendo wa siku tatu, wakapiga kambi yao Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Mara, walisafiri hadi Elimu; huko Elimu kulikuwa na chemchemi kumi na mbili za maji na mitende sabini, wakapiga kambi yao mahali hapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walisafiri kutoka Elimu, wakapiga kambi yao karibu na bahari ya Shamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Bahari ya Shamu walipiga kambi yao katika jangwa la Sini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka jangwa la Sini, walipiga kambi yao Dofka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Dofka walipiga kambi yao huko Alushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Alushi walipiga kambi yao huko Refidimu, ambapo hapakuwa na maji ya kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliondoka Refidimu wakapiga kambi yao katika jangwa la Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Sinai walipiga kambi yao huko Kibroth-hataava. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Kibroth-hataava, walipiga kambi yao huko Haserothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Haserothi, walipiga kambi yao huko Rithma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Rithma, walipiga kambi yao huko Rimon-perezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Rimon-perezi, walipiga kambi yao huko Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Libna walipiga kambi yao Risa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliondoka Risa, wakapiga kambi yao huko Kehelatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Kehelatha, walipiga kambi yao kwenye Mlima Sheferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Mlima Sheferi walipiga kambi yao huko Harada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Harada, walipiga kambi yao huko Makelothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Makelothi, walipiga kambi yao huko Tahathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Tahathi walipiga kambi yao Tera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Tera walipiga kambi yao Mithka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Mithka, walipiga kambi yao Hashmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Hashmona, walipiga kambi yao Moserothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Moserothi, walipiga kambi yao Bene-yaakani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Bene-yaakani, walipiga kambi yao Hor-hagidgadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Hor-hagidgadi, walipiga kambi yao Yot-batha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Yot-batha, walipiga kambi yao Abrona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Abrona, walipiga kambi yao Esion-geberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliondoka Esion-geberi, wakasafiri na kupiga kambi yao katika jangwa la Sini, (yaani Kadeshi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
