          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 20:22-28; Kumb 10:6; 32:50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwa agizo la Mwenyezi-Mungu kuhani Aroni alipanda juu ya Mlima Hori, na huko, akafariki mnamo siku ya kwanza ya mwezi wa tano, mwaka wa arubaini tangu Waisraeli walipotoka nchini Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
